"⌃↑ 快捷键" = "the ⌃↑ shortcut";
"。重新保存一次布局后就不再提示。" = ". Save the layout again and this won't come up any more.";
"不管接的是哪块外接屏，都用同一套桌面和窗口。窗口按所在的桌面和相对位置保存，分辨率不同也能对上；原来同一个桌面上的窗口放回同一个桌面，顺序不变，桌面不够时先自动补，补不上的那几组窗口不移动，并提示你还缺几个。只在接一块外接屏时生效，接两块以上时自动按每块屏单独记。原来各屏的记录都保留。" = "Whichever external display is connected, you get the same desktops and windows. Windows are saved with their desktop and relative position, so different resolutions still line up. Windows that shared a desktop go back onto one desktop, in the same order; if there are too few desktops, more are added first, and any group that still has no desktop stays where it is while you're told how many are missing. Only applies with one external display; with two or more it switches to one layout per display. Each display's existing records are kept.";
"不管鼠标在哪块屏上，音量键都调当前的声音输出设备，不会去调外接显示器自己的音量。" = "Wherever the mouse is, the volume keys change the current sound output device, never the external monitor's own volume.";
